Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-glib-2.0
Recommends: fonts-noto-color-emoji, libxtst6
Suggests: tesseract-ocr
Provides: superdot
Conflicts: superdot
Replaces: superdot
Description: Clipboard, emoji and more Windows shortcuts for Linux: Win+V, Win+. and more
 SuperV brings Windows shortcuts to Linux. Super+V shows the last 25
 things you copied (text and images): pick one to paste it into the app
 you are using, pin favourites, clear the rest. The others are off until
 you turn them on in its settings: Super+. emoji panel, Super+Shift+S
 screenshots with drawing tools, Ctrl+Super+Alt+V paste as plain text,
 Super+Shift+C colour picker, Super+Shift+T copy text from the screen
 (with tesseract-ocr). Works on GNOME, KDE Plasma, Cinnamon, MATE and
 Xfce, on Wayland and X11. Never connects to the internet.
 .
 Replaces SuperDot, which is now part of SuperV.
